---
description: Map a type with the MapLean source generator
globs: "**/*.cs"
alwaysApply: true
---

Map with MapLean by putting `[To]` on a partial method. The method's class is partial. The method takes the source and returns the destination. MapLean writes the method body. Public members with the same name are copied. Nested values, nullable values, and `List<T>` are mapped. A member with no match is left as it is.

```csharp
using MapLean;

public static partial class PersonMap
{
    [To]
    public static partial PersonDto Apply(Person source);
}

public sealed record Person(string Name);
public sealed record PersonDto(string Name);
```
